App is a guide-navigator for truckers. Our goal is to make life easier for drivers on the road.
The app includes:
 - Parking lots;
 - European Union bans;
 - Onboard Logbook;
 - Customs Checkpoints(CIS);
 - Permit system(CIS);
 - Useful information.
We are constantly working to improve our application. More than 6 new features for drivers are in development, such as:
 - Gas stations;
 - Scales;
 - Tolling points;
 - Tachograph (work and rest mode);
 - Schengen Calculator.
Our team collects everything in one application and tries to simplify the life of drivers as much as possible! 
The team consists of international drivers with great experience!
